  "goodToKnow": "Jucken means to itch: Mein Rücken juckt, Es juckt mich am Arm. Figuratively, es juckt mir in den Fingern means I'm itching to do something. Colloquially, Das juckt mich nicht means I don't care: Wen juckt's? (who cares?). Der Juckreiz is itching, and das Juckpulver itching powder. Regular: juckte, gejuckt. Pronounce the j like English y: YUK-en."
